{{!
    @template block_compass/block

    Shell of the Compass block. The server ships labels and configuration; the
    browser fetches tier 1 through block_compass_get_attention and renders the
    cards with core/templates (PLAN.md §3.2). The three strips are rendered here
    empty and hidden, so headings, landmarks and order are stable before any data
    arrives.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * data-region="block_compass" on the root, carrying data-config, a JSON
      string with labels and settings.
    * data-region="status" for the loading message.
    * data-region="error" with data-region="error-text" and data-action="retry".
    * data-region="tier1" wrapping one section per strip, each with data-strip
      (continue, new, favourites) and a data-region="cards" list.
    * data-region="ghost" for the tier 2 ghost card.
    * data-region="explore" where tier 3 renders (see block_compass/explore).
    * data-region="empty" for the empty-state message.
    * data-region="announce" for favourite announcements.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * strips - list of objects with name and title.
    * configjson - JSON string with labels and settings.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "strips": [
            {"name": "continue", "title": "Continue where you left off"},
            {"name": "new", "title": "New enrolments"},
            {"name": "favourites", "title": "My favourites"}
        ],
        "configjson": "{}"
    }
}}
<div id="block_compass-{{uniqid}}" class="compass-root" data-region="block_compass" data-config="{{configjson}}">
    <div class="compass-status text-muted small" data-region="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">
        {{#str}}loading, core{{/str}}
    </div>
    <div class="alert alert-warning compass-error" data-region="error" role="alert" hidden>
        <span data-region="error-text"></span>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary ms-auto" data-action="retry">
            {{#str}}retry, block_compass{{/str}}
        </button>
    </div>
    <div data-region="tier1" hidden>
        {{#strips}}
        <section class="compass-strip" data-strip="{{name}}" aria-labelledby="compass-strip-{{name}}-{{uniqid}}" hidden>
            <h3 class="compass-strip-title h6 text-uppercase text-muted" id="compass-strip-{{name}}-{{uniqid}}">{{title}}</h3>
            <div class="compass-cards" data-region="cards"></div>
        </section>
        {{/strips}}
    </div>
    <div class="compass-ghost-wrap" data-region="ghost" hidden></div>
    <div class="compass-explore-wrap mt-3" data-region="explore" hidden></div>
    <p class="compass-empty text-muted" data-region="empty" hidden></p>
    <span class="visually-hidden" data-region="announce" role="alert" aria-live="assertive"></span>
    <noscript>
        <p class="compass-noscript">{{#str}}javascriptrequired, block_compass{{/str}}</p>
    </noscript>
</div>
{{#js}}
require(['block_compass/main'], function(Main) {
    Main.init('block_compass-{{uniqid}}');
});
{{/js}}
